      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is an implementation detail in the same way that the implementation jar (which is also not provided by the java_sdk_library_import) is an implementation detail.\n\nYou cannot replace a java_sdk_library with java_sdk_library_import and build a working system because the implementation library is missing.\n\nThis is similar to how you cannot build a working system by building against an sdk snapshot, you also need the apex.\n\nIn fact when a java_sdk_library is added to an APEX the permissions file is added to the APEX alongside the implementation jar.",
